==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|vyntener}}, variant of {{m|enm|viniter}}, from {{der|en|fro|vineter}}, {{m|fro|vinetier||wine-merchant, grape-harvester}}, from {{der|en|ML.|vīnētārius||wine dealer}}, from {{m|la|vīnētum||vineyard}}, from {{m|la|vīnum||wine}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|en|/ˈvɪntnɚ/}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈvɪntnə/}}
* {{hyphenation|en|vint|ner}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[seller]] of [[wine]].
# A [[manufacturer]] of wine.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|manufacturer of wine}} {{l|en|winemaker}}

